<title>INDIA: India produced 43,215 tonnes aluminium in April.</title>
<headline>India produced 43,215 tonnes aluminium in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 43,215 tonnes of aluminium in April 1997 compared with 37,766 tonnes in the same month in 1996, a government statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd exported 31,150 tonnes of alumina and 3,274 tonnes of aluminium in April 1997.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Installed		Production</p>
<p>	    capacity	  April 1997     April 1996</p>
<p>	    (annual)</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> BALCO    100,000	     6,948	     7,491</p>
<p> INDAL    117,000	     3,270	     2,321</p>
<p> HINDALCO 210,000	    14,806	     8,840</p>
<p> NALCO    218,000	    16,311	    17,258</p>
<p> MALCO     25,000	     1,880	     1,856</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total    670,000	    43,215	    37,766</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
